You are assisting with business process modelling.

SENTENCES
- These customers usually ask for the appliance to be fixed or swapped for a new one

STATEMENT
such goods are to be replaced

Do these sentences, on their own and taken together, state that the statement is true? Answer yes or no with one line of reason.
Answer with one JSON object that follows the JSON schema below. Output only the JSON, with no other text.

JSON SCHEMA
{
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "description": "yes if the sentence on its own states it, otherwise no",
      "enum": [
        "yes",
        "no"
      ],
      "title": "Answer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reason": {
      "description": "One line of reason",
      "title": "Reason",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "reason"
  ],
  "title": "VerifierOutputV2",
  "type": "object"
}
